  "2026-10-15T06:46:09.804Z",codex-agent,"npm release:check passed under an isolated Git identity: 1140 tests, 1138 passed, 0 failed, 2 optional real-data skips because no external fixture repositories were configured; 100% statements/branches/functions/lines over 25 measured sources. Isolated strict health passes. npm audit --include=dev reports 0 total vulnerabilities. Workflow YAML parses and matches the prescribed caller; no source-function behavior changed, so behavioral revert proof is not applicable. Bun gate is running."
  "2026-10-15T06:52:27.873Z",codex-agent,"Both isolated release gates passed: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each report 1138 passed, 0 failed, 2 optional external real-data skips, 1140 total, with 100% in all four measured coverage dimensions. npm ls braces fast-glob and production-only chain checks remain empty. Changelog generation/check and linked npm run check passed. Ready for PR review; leave the item in_progress for orchestrator verification."
